newmtl aluminium
Ka 1.000000 1.000000 1.000000
Ks 0.500000 0.500000 0.500000
Ke 0.000000 0.000000 0.000000
Ni 1.500000
d 1.000000
illum 3
map_Kd -s 2.5 2.5 1 aluminium_basecolor.png
map_Ns -s 2.5 2.5 1 aluminium_roughness.png
map_Bump -s 2.5 2.5 1 -bm 0.400000 aluminium_normal.png

